    <span>默写；2.能翻译每句诗的</span>\n      <span>意思；3.注释栏处的关键</span>\n      <span>字词的意思都要掌握。</span>\n    </div>\n\n    <section class=\"left-column\">\n      <article class=\"poem\">\n        <div class=\"poem-title\">绝&nbsp;&nbsp;句</div>\n        <div class=\"poem-author\">[唐] 杜甫 <span class=\"phonetic\">fǔ</span></div>\n        迟日江山丽，<br>\n        春风花草香。<br>\n        泥融<span class=\"phonetic\">róng</span>飞燕子，<br>\n        沙暖睡鸳鸯。\n      </article>\n\n      <article class=\"poem\">\n        <div class=\"poem-title\">惠崇<span class=\"phonetic\">huìchóng</span>春江晚景<span class=\"note-mark\">①</span></div>\n        <div class=\"poem-author\">[宋] 苏轼 <span class=\"phonetic\">sū shì</span></div>\n        竹外桃花三两枝，<br>\n        春江水暖鸭先知。<br>\n        蒌蒿满地芦芽短，<br>\n        正是河豚欲上时。\n      </article>\n    </section>\n\n    <aside class=\"annotation\">\n      <section class=\"annotation-section\">\n        <div class=\"annotation-heading\">注释</div>\n        <ol>\n          <li>迟日：春天的太阳。所以说“迟日”。</li>\n          <li>泥融：这里指泥土湿润。</li>\n          <li>鸳鸯：一种鸟，常在水边嬉戏，雌与雄鸟常相伴对生活。</li>\n        </ol>\n      </section>\n\n      <div class=\"focus\">重点</div>\n\n      <section class=\"annotation-section\">\n        <div class=\"annotation-heading\">注释</div>\n        <ol>\n          <li>惠崇是北宋名僧，能诗善画。这首诗是苏轼为惠崇的画作《春江晚景》所写的题画诗。</li>\n          <li>芦蒿：芦蒿的嫩茎。</li>\n          <li>河豚：一种有毒的鱼。</li>\n        </ol>\n      </section>\n    </aside>\n\n    <div class=\"bottom-callout\">\n      我能背出“蒌<br>\n      蒿”是____种植物，<br>\n      因为……\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"placeholder floral-placeholder\" aria-label=\"[插图：左下方花草]\">[插图：左下方花草]</div>\n    <div class=\"placeholder landscape-placeholder\" aria-label=\"[插图：下方山水]\">[插图：下方山水]</div>\n    <div class=\"placeholder ducks-placeholder\" aria-label=\"[插图：右下方水鸟与花枝]\">[插图：右下方水鸟与花枝]</div>\n\n    <div class=\"page-number\">2</div>\n  </main>\n</body>\n</html>"
